<title>CHINA: China's March cereal exports detailed.</title>
<headline>China's March cereal exports detailed.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table shows the barley, corn and rice export figures of up to five major Chinese export offices as well as the destination countries in Jan-March this year.</p>
<p>Details were provided by the General Administration of Customs of China.</p>
<p>Figures are in tonnes. Percentages represent the share of the total market. Percentages may not add up to 100 percent as details of some smaller export regions and destination countries have not been included.</p>
<p>------BARLEY</p>
<p> March exports:   4,765     Jan-March  total exports:    5,337</p>
<p>  CUSTOMS	    March	   Pct	   Jan-March    Pct</p>
<p>    Dalian	  4,765	  100.0	     5,337    100.0</p>
<p>DESTINATION</p>
<p>    North Korea   4,765	  100.0	     5,337    100.0</p>
<p>------RICE</p>
<p> March exports:  36,778	  Jan-March total exports: 81,121</p>
<p>  CUSTOMS	    March	   Pct	   Jan-March Pct</p>
<p>    Dalian	 29,906	   81.3	    64,470     79.5</p>
<p>    Harbin	  1,999	    5.4	     3,820	4.7</p>
<p>    Guangzhou	 797	    2.1	     2,508	3.1</p>
<p>    Changchun     1,623	    4.4	     2,393	2.9</p>
<p>    Urumqi	  1,490	    4.0	     2,189	2.6</p>
<p>DESTINATION</p>
<p>    Japan	  15,594	   42.4	    39,704     48.9</p>
<p>    Liberia	12,999	   35.3	    12,999     16.0</p>
<p>    Russia	  2,462	    6.7	     6,170	7.6</p>
<p>------CORN</p>
<p> March exports:    166,125   Jan-March total exports: 240,341</p>
<p>  CUSTOMS	    March	   Pct	 Jan-March    Pct</p>
<p>    Tianjin	     100	 0.06	     117	0.05</p>
<p>    Shenyang	 12,019	 7.2	   12,019	5.0</p>
<p>    Shijiazhuang   50,369	30.0	   60,402     25.1</p>
<p>    Dalian	  100,676	60.6	  161,800     67.3</p>
<p>    Harbin	    2,960	 1.8	    6,003	2.5</p>
<p>DESTINATIONS</p>
<p>    Cambodia	    100	 0.06	     100	0.04</p>
<p>    Japan		   0	 0.0		 17	0.007</p>
<p>    North Korea    25,588	15.4	   72,813     30.2</p>
<p>    Malaysia	 59,987	36.1	   78,744     32.7</p>
<p>    Phlippines     64,947	39.1	   64,947     27.0</p>
<p>    Singapore	     0	 0.0	    5,176	2.1</p>
<p>    South Korea    12,541	 7.5	   12,542	5.2</p>
<p>    Russia	    2,960	 1.8	    6,003	2.5</p>
